    "firstMessage": {
      "id": 3499801,
      "postDate": "2026-07-18T00:20:53.127Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Hello all, \n\nA few of you might be aware that an exploit of our metrics was found, specifically in the division Jaccard score. \nWe have made a patch and will re-score all submissions as soon as possible (likely Monday). Submissions that did not actively exploit this will not have their scores affected. \n\nIn the meanwhile the patch is already public on https://github.com/royerlab/kaggle-cell-tracking-competition so you can score your submissions locally. \n\nApologies for the mistake and thank you for your understanding. ",
